OL,3,CMajor travel disruption continues for
OL,4,Crail passengers following power outage
OL,6,FTrain passengers face further travel
OL,7,Fchaos on Friday morning after a power
OL,8,Foutage ground trains to a halt across
OL,9,Fthe Midlands and north-west England.
OL,11,FElectricity cut out in the main
OL,12,Fcontrol hub for north-west England's
OL,13,Frailways, the Manchester Rail
OL,14,FOperating Centre near Ashburys station
OL,15,Fin the city's east.
OL,17,FThe failure, shortly before 2pm on
OL,18,FThursday, has caused widespread
OL,19,Fcancellations and delays to services.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
