CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786141095
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption continues for
OL,4,Crail passengers following power outage
OL,6,F"Our engineers are working tirelessly
OL,7,Fto restore the signalling systems
OL,8,Fimpacted by the power cut at
OL,9,Flunchtime."
OL,11,FTrain operators Northern and
OL,12,FTransPennine Express (TPE) advised
OL,13,Fcustomers on Thursday afternoon not to
OL,14,Ftravel, with the latter saying its
OL,15,Ftrains were "unable to run safely"
OL,16,Fbecause of a failure in the
OL,17,Fcommunications systems on the network.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
