OL,3,CMajor travel disruption continues for
OL,4,Crail passengers following power outage
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FAndrew McClements, customer experience
OL,12,Fand transformation director at TPE,
OL,13,Fsaid "sadly, we're not out of the
OL,14,Fwoods yet" following the "difficult
OL,15,Fincident to manage".
OL,17,F"I'd urge people to ensure they check
OL,18,FNational Rail Enquiries before they
OL,19,Fset off on any planned journeys
OL,20,Ftomorrow, with further cancellations
OL,21,Fand delays likely", he added.
