OL,3,CMajor travel disruption continues for
OL,4,Crail passengers following power outage
OL,6,FTPE relaxed ticket restrictions for
OL,7,Fthe whole day, meaning those with
OL,8,Ftickets purchased in advance will be
OL,9,Fable to travel at any time, he said,
OL,10,Fbefore thanking customers for their
OL,11,Fpatience.
OL,13,FThe chief operating officer of
OL,14,FNorthern apologised to all its
OL,15,Faffected customers.
OL,17,FWarrick Dent said: "We know how
OL,18,Ffrustrating it is to have your journey
OL,19,Fdelayed, cancelled, or disrupted, and
OL,20,FI'm sorry for the impact this has had
OL,21,Fon people's day.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
