OL,3,CMajor travel disruption continues for
OL,4,Crail passengers following power outage
OL,6,F"Our teams have been working hard
OL,7,Falongside Network Rail and other train
OL,8,Foperators to keep customers moving and
OL,9,Finformed throughout.
OL,11,F"The scale of today's disruption means
OL,12,Fcustomers travelling through
OL,13,FManchester tomorrow morning should
OL,14,Falso check before they travel, as some
OL,15,Fknock-on delays may continue."
OL,17,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander on
OL,18,FThursday afternoon said she is
OL,19,F"receiving regular updates" while
OL,20,FNetwork Rail works to resolve what she
OL,21,Fdescribed as a "power outage".
OL,26,@{D@AOU{D@[O]}D@POU}D@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
