OL,3,CMajor travel disruption continues for
OL,4,Crail passengers following power outage
OL,6,FAlexander added: "Disruption is
OL,7,Fexpected during the rest of the day,
OL,8,Fso please check before you travel."
OL,10,FThe Manchester facility that
OL,11,Fexperienced the outage was one of 12
OL,12,Foperating centres built to eventually
OL,13,Fmanage the entire British rail
OL,14,Fnetwork, Network Rail said when it
OL,15,Fopened in 2014.
OL,17,FThese facilities replaced 800 signal
OL,18,Fboxes and other operational locations
OL,19,Fthen used to control trains.
OL,26,@nD@ROUpD@cO]
