OL,3,CMajor travel disruption continues for
OL,4,Crail passengers following power outage
OL,6,FIt was planned that the Manchester
OL,7,FRail Operating Centre would control
OL,8,Fall of the railway in north-west
OL,9,FEngland by 2034.
OL,11,FA wartime bomb being discovered near
OL,12,Fthe railway between Tamworth and
OL,13,FBurton-on-Trent also added to the
OL,14,Fdisruption, with all lines blocked,
OL,15,FNational Rail said.
OL,17,FGreater Manchester, the Midlands and
OL,18,Fnorth-west England bore the brunt of
OL,19,Fthe impact.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
