OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786141095
OL,3,CMajor travel disruption continues for
OL,4,Crail passengers following power outage
OL,6,FAn electrical fault at Manchester
OL,7,FPiccadilly also halted trains in April.
OL,9,FAn extended 12-hour closure of the
OL,10,Frailway was needed for repairs because
OL,11,Fof the "complex area where this took
OL,12,Fplace, with over 400 metres of damaged
OL,13,Flines", Network Rail said at the time.
OL,15,FA National Rail spokesperson said: "If
OL,16,Fyou're travelling Avanti West Coast,
OL,17,FCrossCountry, East Midlands Railway,
OL,18,FLondon Northwestern, Northern,
OL,19,FTransPennine Express, or Transport for
OL,20,FWales in the affected area, your train
OL,21,Fmay be cancelled, delayed, or revised."
